, "size": [270.2373962402344, 96.54638671875], "pos": [-5596.72412109375, -2272.84814453125], "id": 26, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [34], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["[Verse 1]  \nSunlight spills like whispered secrets on bare feet,  \nShe sits at edge where dreams still breathe.  \nWhite tank top, denim wide—no armor to pretend,  \nJust quiet weight against her skin’s soft bend.\n\n[Prechorus]  \nThoughts drift down like leaves from window frames,  \nNo map for where she’ll land… no name for why she stays.\n\n[Chorus]  \nBack and forth across this bed,  \nTill words dissolve — half-said, half-broken.  \nSitting here with shadows near,  \nBetween what she meant... and what she dared to hear.\n\n[Verse 2]  \nCurtains flutter low as dawn creeps past,  \nHer fingers trace the line where sleep ends, day begins.  \nShe traces spaces left by unspoken truths,  \nAnd wonders if her voice ever truly touched.\n\n[Prechorus]  \nThey stack inside her chest like silent stones,  \nEach one asking: “When do you stop?”  \n\n[Chorus]  \nAround and around the edges of the room,  \nWords echo backward while she leans so far ahead.  \nBarefooted now beneath the sunlit floor,  \nStill living just beyond the truth we dare to share.\n\n[Outro]  \nSo let it linger — don’t rush its leave.  \nThis moment holds more than any speech could give.  \nLet it settle, softly worn,  \nIn rooms that hold both light and shadow grown."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 28, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [276.8421630859375, 566.5265502929688], "pos": [-5598.09423828125, -2116.701904296875], "id": 25, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order